  <p>
    <strong>What to notice:</strong> each explanation gives the diagnostic, not just
    the label — associate versus part for metonymy, the ABBA mirror for chiasmus, the
    negated opposite for litotes. Answer first, then read the feedback and check you
    could have written the second sentence: the job of the figure, not its name.
  </p>
